  "problem": "The new self-hosted default-model early return bypassed observedModel: admitted successful, streaming and rejected invocations emitted no AI generation receipt.",
  "change": [
    "Wrap only the existing selfHostedDefaultModel(scope) in observedModel.",
    "Add closed self_hosted route; actual modelId comes from the configured provider model, not the hosted UI alias.",
    "Preserve explicit owner or same-workspace billing owner and operation/tier/effort metadata."
  ],
  "preserved": [
    "Original per-call admission, direct configured provider, prompt size guard, output bounds and timeout.",
    "No Gateway fallback, billing reservation or settlement, or new authentication/database call.",
    "Original provider result, stream and rejection behavior.",
    "Missing cost and nonstreaming TTFT remain absent; no zero values are invented."
  ],
  "privacy": [
    "The provider factory and PostHog capture are in-memory mocks; no real provider or telemetry transport is used.",
    "Static prompt, response, request, caller Gateway-key, baseURL and API-key canaries are absent from captured generation events.",
    "The transport still receives its original configured values; telemetry does not receive those values."
  ],
